    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "once-upon",
        "title": "Okutandika olufumo",
        "body": [
          "Enfumo mu Lungereza zitandika ne **Once upon a time …** Abantu b’omu lufumo boogerwako ne **there was**: **There was a man. There was a woman and her child.**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "and-then",
        "title": "And then …",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda **ne-** kigatta ebyaliwo: **n’agenda, n’alaba**. Mu Lungereza kozesa ebikolwa by’ebyayita ne **and** oba **then**: **Then he went into the forest. And he saw a lion!**"
        ],
        "table": [
          ["Leero", "Mu lufumo"],
          ["go", "went"],
          ["see", "saw"],
          ["say", "said"],
          ["come", "came"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "the-end",
        "title": "Enkomerero",
        "body": [
          "**In the end, he went back home.** Olufumo luggwa ne **The end.** oba **And that is the end of my story.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Enfumo ez’ekiro",
        "body": [
          "Mu Buganda enfumo zinyumizibwa ekiro okumpi n’omuliro. Mu Lungereza abazadde basomera abaana **bedtime stories** nga tebannaba kwebaka."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "amaras-story",
      "title": "Amara anyumya olufumo",
      "unlockAfter": "u35s3l3",
      "cast": ["amara", "emma"],
      "summary": "Amara anyumiza Emma olufumo lw’omulenzi n’empologoma.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Amara, tell me a story!",
            "base": "Amara, ngerera enfumo!"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Well then. Once upon a time, there was a boy.",
            "base": "Kale nno. Olwatuuka olwali olumu, waaliwo omulenzi omu."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Then he went into the forest to look for firewood.",
            "base": "Awo n’agenda mu kibira okunoonya enku."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Lwaki omulenzi yagenda mu kibira?",
          "options": ["To find firewood", "To hunt", "To play football"],
          "optionsLang": "target",
          "answer": 0
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "And what did he see?",
            "base": "N’alaba ki?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "He saw a very big lion!",
            "base": "N’alaba empologoma nnene nnyo!"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Oh! Did he run?",
            "base": "Ayi! N’adduka?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "No. He sat down and sang a song.",
            "base": "Nedda. N’atuula wansi, n’ayimba oluyimba."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Omulenzi yakola ki bwe yalaba empologoma?",
          "options": [
            "He ran away",
            "He sat and sang a song",
            "He climbed a tree"
          ],
          "optionsLang": "target",
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "The lion listened, rested and went away.",
            "base": "Empologoma n’ewuliriza, n’ewummula, n’egenda."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "In the end, the boy went home with the firewood. My story ends there.",
            "base": "Ekyavaamu, omulenzi n’addayo awaka n’enku. Enfumo yange ekomye awo."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Amara amaliriza atya olufumo mu Lungereza?",
          "options": [
            "My story ends there.",
            "Once upon a time, one day…",
            "There was a man."
